# Carbuncle Debacle (battlefield.carbuncle_debacle_cloister_of_gales, CloisterOfGales): the requirement arms of the
# registrant (BattlefieldQuest's check: only the registrant needs the quest state and the item). Main, a level 75
# Warrior with the quest accepted and the pendulum but CarbuncleDebacleProgress 5: the trade to WP_Entrance: no options.
# bob, CarbuncleDebacleProgress 6 and the pendulum, the quest only available: no options. cat, accepted and
# CarbuncleDebacleProgress 6 but no pendulum (no trade): no options. dan, the quest completed, CarbuncleDebacleProgress
# 6 and the pendulum: a registrant needs accepted: no options.
lists CloisterOfGales/WP_Entrance/onTrade CloisterOfGales/WP_Entrance/onTrigger
char zone=CloisterOfGales pos=-357.6,-0.1,-380.0 job=WAR lvl=75
char bob zone=CloisterOfGales pos=-357.6,-0.1,-380.0 job=WAR lvl=75
char cat zone=CloisterOfGales pos=-357.6,-0.1,-380.0 job=WAR lvl=75
char dan zone=CloisterOfGales pos=-357.6,-0.1,-380.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.CarbuncleDebacle accepted
charvar CarbuncleDebacleProgress 5
item WindPendulum
bob: charvar CarbuncleDebacleProgress 6
bob: item WindPendulum
cat: quest Windurst.CarbuncleDebacle accepted
cat: charvar CarbuncleDebacleProgress 6
dan: quest Windurst.CarbuncleDebacle completed
dan: charvar CarbuncleDebacleProgress 6
dan: item WindPendulum
login
trade WP_Entrance WindPendulum x1      # CarbuncleDebacleProgress 5: no options
bob: login
bob: trade WP_Entrance WindPendulum x1 # available: no options
cat: login
cat: trigger WP_Entrance               # no pendulum traded: no options
dan: login
dan: trade WP_Entrance WindPendulum x1 # completed: no options
